  "changes": [
    {
      "zh": "修复关闭后重新打开提示「上次的端口已被占用」的问题。根因为端口探测与实际监听的方式不一致：探测使用未开启地址复用的裸 socket，上一次会话残留的 TIME_WAIT 连接会让它误判端口仍被占用，于是自动改用下一个端口并弹窗；而代理自身通过 asyncio 监听（默认开启地址复用），本可直接复用原端口。现两者口径已统一，TIME_WAIT 期间直接沿用原端口，不再切换、不再弹窗。真正被其他程序占用的端口仍会被正确识别并顺延",
      "en": "Fixed the 'last port still in use' prompt shown when relaunching MiteProxy. The cause was a mismatch between port probing and actual listening: the probe used a plain socket without address reuse, so TIME_WAIT connections left by the previous session made it treat the port as busy, and the app switched to the next port and showed a dialog - even though the proxy itself listens via asyncio (address reuse enabled) and could have reused the original port. Probing and listening now agree, so the original port is reused during TIME_WAIT with no port switch and no dialog. Ports genuinely held by other programs are still detected and skipped as before"
    }
  ]
}
